deriving instance Inhabited for TraitImplRef
deriving instance Inhabited for TraitParam
deriving instance Inhabited for TraitRefKind
deriving instance Inhabited for TraitRefContents
deriving instance Inhabited for TyKind
deriving instance Inhabited for ConstGenericParam
